<title>SPAIN: Electric protocol to be signed today - IndMin.</title>
<headline>Electric protocol to be signed today - IndMin.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Industry Ministry and electricity companies will sign the electricity protocol this evening, a spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The protocol will set out a new framework for regulation of the sector, in a move towards a more competitive environment.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
